    kg:textSpan "and 3 . 3 . More importantly, TC-FPx achieves similar performance with Finegrained_W4A16, which is 1 . 06 / 1 . 04 / 0 . 94 faster than Fine-grained_W4A16 when running all these linear layers at batch size 8/16/32, respectively. Besides, TC-FPx is only 16% / 17% / 24% slower than Coarse-grained_W4A16 at batch size 8/16/32. Since 6-bit quantization can provide significantly higher model quality, it is a worthwhile trade-off. MatMul MHA NCCL Others 350 FP6-LLM 1GPU FP16 1GPU 80 300 Token / GPU-Sec" .

