    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2401_14351_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "depicted in Figure 4 with its steps defined below: 5.2 Making Live Migration Efficient We aim to achieve efficient live migration of LLM inference, incurring minimal resource overhead and minimal user interruption. We initially considered using the snapshot method from Singularity [ 68 ], which involves snapshotting the LLM inference. However, this method is slow due to lengthy snapshot creation and transfer times ( e.g., typically 10s seconds or even minutes). Dirty-page-based migration might b" .

