    kg:textSpan "PagedAttention. Overall, we make the following contributions: We present vAttention a memory management approach that retains the virtual contiguity of KV cache while enabling dynamic allocation of physical memory. Our implementation of vAttention in vLLM seamlessly adds dynamic memory allocation support to various unmodified attention kernels. We compare vAttention against PagedAttention-based alternatives of vLLM, FlashAttention-2 and FlashInfer on Yi-6B, Llama-3-8B and Yi-34B with 1-2 A100 GP" .

