    kg:textSpan "Hence, we need to consider batch size along with cached-ratio. (4) When the historical KV cache data is located in DRAM, we must swap it into HBM before using it during prefill. Yet, the benefit of 8.3 End-to-End Applications We study the benefits of context caching, disaggregated inference, and when both are combined. We create four different settings: (1) PD denotes PD-colocated. (2) PD-CC denotes PD-colocated with context caching. (3) 1P1D denotes disaggregated inference with a single prefill" .

