    kg:textSpan "simultaneously increase the queueing delay and decrease the throughput of short requests. We evaluate the reservation-based scheduling strategy using the same setup described in 6.2. PecSched: Preemptive and Efficient Cluster Scheduling for LLM Inference 5 We begin by analyzing the GPU idle rate in the cluster under a reservation-based scheduling strategy. We define the GPU idle rate as: GPU Idle Rate = ( + ) , (1) where and are the total execution time and the total idle time of GPU , respectiv" .

