    kg:textSpan "Revisiting Service Level Objectives and System Level Metrics in Large Language Model Serving Zhibin Wang 1 , Shipeng Li 1 , Yuhang Zhou 1 , Xue Li 2 , Zhonghui Zhang 1 , Nguyen Cam-Tu 1 , Rong Gu 1 , Chen Tian 1 , Guihai Chen 1 , Sheng Zhong 1 1 State Key Laboratory for Novel Software Technology, Nanjing University 2 Alibaba Group Abstract User experience is a critical factor Large Language Model (LLM) serving systems must consider, where service level objectives (SLOs) considering the experienc" .

