    kg:textSpan "Is the GPU Half-Empty or Half-Full? Practical Scheduling Techniques for LLMs Ferdi Kossmann 1 , , Bruce Fontaine 2 , Daya Khudia 2 , Michael Cafarella 1 , Samuel Madden 1 1 MIT CSAIL, 2 Databricks {ferdik, michjc, madden}@csail.mit.edu, {bruce.fontaine, daya.khudia}@databricks.com Request Abstract arXiv:2410.17840v2 [cs.LG] 28 Jan 2025 Load balancer Serving systems for Large Language Models (LLMs) improve throughput by processing several requests concurrently. However, multiplexing hardware reso" .

