    kg:textSpan "representations of the prompt tokens. The LLM may batch several tokens of the user prompt together and propagate them through the LLM as one batch. This typically makes the prefill phase compute-bound , meaning that the GPU spends more time on arithmetic than on moving data from memory to the arithmetic units. Upon completion of the prefill phase, the LLM produces the first response token and the request enters the decode phase . During the decode phase, each forward pass only propagates a singl" .

