    kg:textSpan "compute fragmentation when requests of different lengths are batched together. PagedAttention [ 41 ] and vAttention [ 47 ] proposed different techniques for dynamic memory management for LLM inference. Sarathi-Serve [ 23 ] leverages chunked prefills to enable stall-free batching. In contrast, Splitwise [ 46 ], DistServe [ 65 ] and TetriInfer [ 35 ] disaggregate the prefill and decode phases onto different GPU nodes to avoid interference between these phases. Various recent works have also propos" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2410_18038_rag__chunk_021> a kg:Chunk ;
