    kg:textSpan "online services, MPIC improves the throughput by 2.0 compared to the state-of-the-art approach. In addition, the generation quality of MPIC does not degrade as the number of images grows. 2 B ACKGROUND AND M OTIVATION 2.1 B ENEFITS OF C ONTEXT C ACHING (CC) The CC technique has been shown to enhance the efficiency and performance of the MLLM through the storage and reuse of the context of prior interactions. In a video analysis task, for instance, the user is likely to refer to the video multipl" .

