    kg:textSpan "MPIC in the online scenario. The sensitivity analysis is left to Appendix C due to page limit. 5.1 E XPERIMENTAL SETTINGS We select two prevalent MLLMs in the experiments: LLaVA-1.6-vicuna-7B and LLaVA-1.6- mistral-7B Liu et al. (2024b). All experiments are run on a server with 1 NVIDIA H800-80 GB GPU, 20-core Intel(R) Xeon(R) Platinum CPUs, and 100GB DRAM. Two datasets are used in our evaluation. (1) MMDU Liu et al. (2024d) aims to evaluate MLLMs abilities in multi-turn and multi-image conversa" .

