    kg:textSpan "Furthermore, speculative inference does not necessitate additional retraining or fine-tuning of the LLM and can be readily integrated into well-established acceleration frameworks like vLLM [4]. Despite its promise, speculative inference faces two major challenges that hinder widespread adoption. (1) Disparate Resource Demands: Speculative inference divergent resource demands stemming from the architectural disparity between memory-intensive SSMs and compute-intensive LLMs [ 10 ]. Although SSMs " .

