    kg:textSpan "Length Increase ( ) 1.69 1.70 1.55 1.76 0 2.2 2000 4000 Prompt Length 2000 4000 KV Length (a) Prefill, Batch 1 (b) Decode, Batch 1 4.3 Length Distribution Analysis Figure 3. The execution time of the attention layer of various compression algorithms measured across different prompt lengths. Lossy compression can elicit LLMs to yield different lengths of responses. Despite potential throughput benefits from KV cache compression, the lengthy responses can still prolong the end-to-end latency. We f" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2503_24000_rag__chunk_015> a kg:Chunk ;
