    kg:textSpan "TTFT and TPOT SLO attainments are 1.23 and 1.63 better than without, which verifies the benefits of our block layout for efficient resource sharing and better SLO attainments of RT requests. 7.4.2 Scheduling Overheads. We evaluate the overheads of the request scheduling, which involves sorting RT and BE requests and multiple cost model queries at each iteration. We run OPT-13B and OPT-30B models with hybrid RT and BE requests as in Sec. 7.2. We measure the time to finish scheduling as well as th" .

