    kg:textSpan "there was minimal concern about computational resource constraints or the need for fine-grained control over text delivery speed. In contrast, modern chat-based LLMs have brought the challenge of text streaming to the forefront. Because LLMs require substantial computational power and generate content token by token, their responses are typically streamed to users at a rate determined by the available computational resources and model complexity. This means that users must consume the content in" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2504_17999_rag__chunk_019> a kg:Chunk ;
