    kg:docId "2504.20068_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2504_20068_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "uncertainty that can lead to suboptimal online decisions. Preempting running requests to correct these errors, however, incurs non-trivial overheads (e.g., batch stalls and KV cache swaps), which may outweigh benefits if not carefully controlled. JITServe mitigates this with two safeguards. First, because preemption overhead scales with the KV cache size to be released, the resulting stall time is predictable given the KV cache size and I/O bandwidth. JITServe estimates the potential goodput los" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2504_20828_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
