    kg:textSpan "each token resides during inference. Parallel model weight loading. The time spent on (2) model weight loading is heavily influenced by the utilization of the CPUGPU interconnect bandwidth. We found that loading models navely via the cudaMemcpyAsync API to a GPU fails to saturate the interconnect bandwidth, even when invoked from multiple threads. This may be due to all cudaMemcpyAsync operations targeting the same GPU executing serially, limited by the CUDA driver and hardware. Prism overcomes " .

