    kg:docId "2505.07203_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2505_07203_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "KV cache discarding, where PrefillOnly maximally preserves the KV cache of prefix tokens in GPU and discards the KV cache of suffix tokens. We note that hybrid prefilling is the enabler of this technique, as hybrid prefilling only prefills each request within one LLM inference, allowing one to potentially discard part of the KV cache without worrying about slowing down the inference. Also, our implementation does not change the hardware kernels as we reuse the abstractions created by sliding win" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2505_07203_rag__chunk_015> a kg:Chunk ;
