    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2505_07203_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "observe that LLMs are increasingly being used in traditional discriminative tasks such as recommendation, credit verification, and data labeling. A new workload the prefill-only workload emerges under this trend, where LLMs generate only a single output token per request. Existing LLM engines perform suboptimally on such workloads, as their designs are specialized for multi-token generation. In this paper, we propose PrefillOnly, the first LLM inference engine tailored specifically for prefill-o" .

