    kg:textSpan "ServerlessLoRA : Minimizing Latency and Cost in Serverless Inference for LoRA-Based LLMs Yifan Sui Hao Wang Stevens Institute of Technology Hoboken, USA hwang212@stevens.edu Hanfei Yu Stevens Institute of Technology Hoboken, USA hyu42@stevens.edu Shanghai Jiao Tong University Shanghai, China suiyifan@sjtu.edu.cn Jianxun Li Yitao Hu Tianjin University Tianjin, China yitao@tju.edu.cn Hao Wang Stevens Institute of Technology Hoboken, USA hwang9@stevens.edu Shanghai Jiao Tong University Shanghai, Ch" .

