    kg:textSpan "supports the decision-making of the SLO guarantee modules. Orchestrating these modules together, we implement S CORPIO . Compared to state-of-the-art baselines, our methods improve the system goodput by up to 14.4 and the SLO adherence rate by up to 46.5% under different scenarios. 2 Background and Problem Formulation A typical LLM generative inference task has two stages: i) the prefill stage, which takes a prompt sequence to generate the first output token; and ii) the decoding stage, which ge" .

