    kg:textSpan "to process each token. Recent publicly available MoE models match or exceed dense model quality, and commercial LLMs such as GPT-4, LLaMA-4, DeepSeek R1, and Gemini 1.5 use MoE architectures [ 3 , 13 , 16 , 25 , 35 , 42 44 ]. MoEs reduce data movement significantly by fetching only the selected experts. For example, in Figure 2 -right, the router activates only 2 out of 8 experts. 2.3 The Effectiveness of Speculation The primary benefit of speculation is a higher effective token rate (ETR)the av" .

