    kg:textSpan "Nexus: Proactive Intra-GPU Disaggregation of Prefill and Decode in LLM Serving Xiaoxiang Shi Colin Cai lambda7xx@gmail.com Independent Researcher cai9@berkeley.edu Independent Researcher Junjia Du junjia001@e.ntu.edu.sg Nanyang Technological University Zhihao Jia zhihao@cmu.edu Carnegie Mellon University Abstract Current prefilldecode (PD) disaggregation is typically deployed at the level of entire serving engines 1 , assigning separate GPUs to handle prefill and decode phases. While effective a" .

