    kg:textSpan "heavy prefill and memor bound decode in chunked batches creates finegrained interference that increases TBT. Second, both stages exhibit diminishing returns beyond moderate compute allocations overprovisioning is wasteful, and equal partitioning is inefficient. Third, modern accelerators [ 34 , 36 ] now provide sufficient on device memory and compute to support disaggregation within a single engine, avoiding the communication overheads of cross-GPU designs. However, enabling this form of disaggr" .

