    kg:textSpan "token, which is compute-bound [ 2 ]. The decode stage generates subsequent tokens in an autoregressive manner, which is memory-bound. To cope with the distinct computational characteristics of these two stages, recent researches have proposed a prefill-decode disaggregated architecture [ 32 , 34 , 55 ]. In such architecture, prefill and decode operations are allocated to separate nodes, with communication between nodes being enabled via KV cache transmission [34]. Compared with pure language mod" .

