    kg:textSpan "lacks visibility into the schedulers preemption decisions, forcing it to evict based solely on memory pressure rather than scheduling intent; (2) the inference engine cannot anticipate memory operations, leading to unpredictable runtime latency spikes; and (3) the absence of a unified management Request Tracker Virtual Buffer Counter Buffer-aware Scheduler (a) (b) (c) (d) Waiting Queue Req (a) Running Requests Req (b) Req (c) Req (d) Schedule Decision GPU CPU Request Manager CPU Memory Pool Req " .

