    kg:textSpan "write-through with additional optimizations (highlighted in red). contrast, TokenFlow exploits GPU I/O idle periods to preemptively offload KV caches to CPU memory. As a result, when preemption actually occurs, most of the cache has already been written back, rendering the KV cache offload operation nearly instantaneous. To further align memory management with our proactive principle, we incorporate a write-through policy, synchronous chunked writing, and overlapped load-evict operations. Togeth" .

