    kg:textSpan "Similar to throughput but inspired by video streaming experience, this metric evaluates real-time streaming performance by applying a timelinessbased weight to each token based on empirical observations of user consumption patterns: Tokens are fully counted when the buffer size is below 1 = 10% of the total output length, as they are immediately consumable. Token contribution decays linearly to zero as the buffer grows from 1 = 10% to 2 = 20%, reflecting tokens stored to mitigate network or reso" .

