    kg:textSpan "drastically increase TTFT, while Andes fails to maintain balanced streaming performance. TokenFlow overcomes these limitations and delivers both low latency and consistent output rates even at peak loads. 7.4 Micro Experiments Token Generation Timeline: Our qualitative comparison with SGLangs scheduling in Figure 18 highlights TokenFlow s dual advantages: it initiates service earlier while maintaining precise token delivery at required speeds, unlike [TABLE id=2510.02758_p13_t2] caption: Table 2" .

