    kg:textSpan "with different computational properties. In the compute-bound prefill phase, all tokens in the input prompt are processed in parallel to generate the KV cache and the first output token. In the memory-bound decode phase, subsequent output tokens are generated sequentially, where each new token depends on the KV cache state of all previous tokens. This dual-phase nature poses a challenge for existing hardware since each phase effectively utilizes only a subset of the hardware resources. To improv" .

