    kg:textSpan "Lethe: Layer- and Time-Adaptive KV Cache Pruning for Reasoning-Intensive LLM Serving Hui Zeng 1, 2 , Daming Zhao 3 , Pengfei Yang 1* , WenXuan Hou 1 , Tianyang Zheng 1 , Hui Li 1 , Weiye Ji 1 , Jidong Zhai 3 1 Xidian University, Xian, China 2 Zhongguancun Academy, Beijing, China 3 Tsinghua University, Beijing, China hzeng@stu.xidian.edu.cn, cszdm@mail.tsinghua.edu.cn, pfyang@xidian.edu.cn Abstract generation, CoT-style generation introduces a unique challenge: tokens are not statically provided " .

