    kg:textSpan "median, to highlight the variability) (left) and a publicly available Twitter trace [ 3 ] (right), which has been used in prior ML inference evaluations [ 23 , 65 ]. These demonstrate that a T2I inference system running SD-XL models on 8 A100 GPUs cannot reliably meet user demand during load spikes. Conversely, provisioning for peak load leads to signi!cant resource wastage. CCS Concepts Computer systems organization ; Networks Cloud computing ; Computing methodologies Arti!cial intelligence ; K" .

