    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2511_21862_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "(2) a fast preemption mechanism that strictly enforces Service Level Objectives (SLOs) for online requests. Experiments on real-world traces show that compared to existing offline system approaches, our method improves offline throughput by up to 3, while maintaining online request SLOs. 1 Introduction The explosive growth of Large Language Models (LLMs) is profoundly transforming human-computer interaction and information processing. Recently, they have been widely applied in domains such as ch" .

