    kg:textSpan "with a public dataset), Vicuna- 33B ( Chiang et al. , 2023 ) (trained with a private dataset 1 ), and Zephyr-7B (trained with both supervised fine-tuning and alignment). M EDUSA can achieve a speedup of 2.3 to 2.8 times across different prompt types without compromising on the quality of generation. We further enhance M EDUSA with two key insights. Firstly, the current approach of generating a single candidate continuation at each decoding step leads to inefficient use of computational resources" .

