    kg:textSpan "al. [ 2023a ]. Safety alignment focuses on the models inherent ability to autonomously recognize and refuse to respond to harmful inquiries, thereby safeguarding against generating inappropriate or dangerous content Ouyang et al. [ 2022 ]. Reliability pertains to the models stability when confronted with unconventional data in longtail scenarios, such as interference from adversarial examples or with decision shortcuts Geirhos et al. [ 2020 ]. In the following parts, we will delve into how diffe" .

