    kg:textSpan "cache streaming depend on the pipeline setup, and network topology. For instance, when disaggregating prompt processing from token generation, the prompt KV cache is transferred from the prompt processing to the token generation machines. This can occur through various mechanisms, such as GPU-GPU or CPU-CPU copies. Moreover, the prompt and token pipelines might have different pipeline depths and batch sizes, requiring splitting or merging the KV cache at the source and destination respectively. " .

