    kg:textSpan "RELATED WORK Inference serving with SLO guarantee. Multiple works have been proposed with SLO guarantees [ 12 , 18 , 31 , 32 ]. Model switch [ 38 ] switches to a different model architecture in response to workload changes to ensure SLO. GrandSLAm [ 23 ] uses dynamic batching and request reordering to increase system throughput with the SLO guarantee. InFaaS [ 29 ] gets user preferences about accuracy, cost, or performance and provides a model variant to satisfy the requested SLO. Jellyfish [ 27" .

