    kg:textSpan "vAttention: Dynamic Memory Management for Serving LLMs without PagedAttention Ajay Nayak Ramya Prabhu Microsoft Research Bengaluru, India Jayashree Mohan Microsoft Research Bengaluru, India Indian Institute of Science Bengaluru, India Ramchandran Ramjee Microsoft Research Bengaluru, India Ashish Panwar Microsoft Research Bengaluru, India arXiv:2405.04437v3 [cs.LG] 29 Jan 2025 System/library and issues related to PagedAttention Abstract vLLM [ 51 ]: Pioneered PagedAttention. Despite being in an a" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2405_04437_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
