    kg:textSpan "same set of active KV cache to the decode-only instance, wasting bandwidth and affecting the time-to-second-token. We therefore propose the next design milestone to address this issue. (c) PD-Caching-2. This design enables caching at the decode-only instance to reduce repeated data movement. We make two key changes atop PD-Caching-1. First, the prefill-only instance now calls transfer_with_insert instead of transfer such that the decode-only instance will insert the transmitted KV cache produced" .

