    kg:textSpan "the distribution of model weights. As illustrated in Figure 13, we place all non-expert weights and a portion of experts, in multiple precision versions, in GPU memory, and all expert weights reside in CPU memory. To ensure the system performs efficiently across various hardware setups, we implement two computing modes: GPU-centric computing and CPU-GPU cooperative computing. In the GPU-centric computing mode, when input is processed, the main thread handles it on the GPU using the corresponding" .

