    kg:textSpan "TokenLake: A Unified Segment-level Prefix Cache Pool for Fine-grained Elastic Long-Context LLM Serving Bingyang Wu 1 Zili Zhang 1 Yinmin Zhong 1 Guanzhe Huang 2 Yibo Zhu 2 Xuanzhe Liu 1 Xin Jin 1 1 Peking University 2 StepFun Abstract KV cache size increases linearly with the sequence length, efficiently managing such a large volume of KV cache to achieve a high cache hit rate has become a critical problem. A popular approach to maximize cache utilization is to use cache-aware routing [ 31 , 44 " .

