    kg:textSpan "handle more concurrent requests than GPU memory can physically accommodate. This necessitates a hierarchical architecture supporting two fundamental operations: (a) preempt to offload KV cache from preempted requests, and (b) resume to reload cached data when requests regain execution. Unlike popular LLM serving frameworks like SGLang, which manage KV cache reactively to optimize GPU throughput for dynamic batching, the key distinction of our approach lies in its proactive design philosophy. Exi" .

