        "Speculative decoding (SD) frameworks maintain two models: the target model, denoted as M T , is the one which we want the SD frameworks to sample from; the draft model, denoted as M D"^^xsd:string,
        "Speculative decoding (SD) frameworks maintain two models: the target model, denoted as M T , is the one which we want the SD frameworks to sample from; the draft model, denoted as M D , is the one that proposes candidate tokens"^^xsd:string,
