    kg:docId "2404.00704v1_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2404_00704v1_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "distributed autoscaling to meet slas of machine learning inference services with resource efficiency. In ACM/IFIP/USENIX Middleware Conference . 109120. [18] Arpan Gujarati, Reza Karimi, Safya Alzayat, Wei Hao, Antoine Kaufmann, Ymir Vigfusson, and Jonathan Mace. 2020. Serving DNNs like Clockwork: Performance Predictability from the Bottom Up. In USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation (OSDI) . 443462. [19] Jashwant Raj Gunasekaran, Cyan Subhra Mishra, Prashanth Thinakara" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2405_19213_rag__chunk_004> a kg:Chunk ;
