    kg:textSpan "original form or by modifying them through fine-tuning or by running custombuilt models. Serverless inference can significantly reduce costs for LLM users by charging only for the duration of inference and the volume of processed data. These serverless platforms also offer functionalities such as auto-scaling and auto-failurerecovery to keep instances in an \"always-on\" state. For the providing companies, serverless inference allows effective (2) Efficient live migration of LLM inference. We moti" .

