    kg:textSpan "system throughput (batch size) for further optimizing the inference capabilities. Since batched execution latency is dominated by the longest request and batch size in the batch, the scheduler selectively groups requests from the request pool based on the current load and optimal batch size constraints. This strategy aligns the computational contributions of the server 18 Get verification accuracy D using Equation (1) 19 Draft verified in the server 20 Update routing matrix M using Equation (4) " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2503_17707_rag__chunk_004> a kg:Chunk ;
