    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2504_07494_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "manager is responsible for determining the batch schedule at the start of each inference iteration, while the inference engine assigns GPU workers to efficiently process the scheduled batch of requests. In each iteration, the workers perform a pass over the model parameters to generate one output token in parallel for each request within the batch. Within the scheduler and the inference engine, Apt-Serve further incorporates more sophisticated lower-level designs. The 130:10 Shihong Gao, Xin Zha" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2504_11816_rag__chunk_004> a kg:Chunk ;
    kg:chunkId "2504.11816_rag::chunk_004" ;
